Your homepage puts your email address above the project photographs.

I'm Nathanael from Northframe, a website design studio. I've prepared a priva=
te concept that reverses that emphasis: a finished piece introduces the busin=
ess, the work explains the types of projects you take on, and the contact opt=
ion stays close by.

I've attached the PDF and a 15-second scroll video. It's an independent propo=
sal; nothing has been published or changed on your current website.

Would a site in this direction suit Twisted Metals?

